OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme porn has 'normalised'
OL,4,Aviolence against women, leading KC
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore young men are being tried for sex
OL,8,Fcrimes in the High Court as extreme
OL,9,Fporn has "normalised" violence against
OL,10,Fwomen, according to one of Scotland's
OL,11,Ftop defence advocates.
OL,13,FTony Lenehan KC also believes a new
OL,14,Fmisogyny bill will help educate men
OL,15,Fthat sex acts, such as strangulation,
OL,16,Fare illegal and potentially reduce
OL,17,Fviolence against women.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
