OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme porn has 'normalised'
OL,4,Aviolence against women, leading KC
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FLenehan told the BBC's Scotcast that
OL,8,Fthere was nothing in the Scottish
OL,9,Fgovernment's plans that wasn't already
OL,10,Fcapable of being brought before a
OL,11,Fcourt.
OL,13,FBut he believes the publicity and
OL,14,Fmessaging around the proposed
OL,15,Flegislation will make men think twice
OL,16,Fabout their actions.
